: [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I haven't placed the order yet because I can't tell which monitor the design team standardised on.\n\nThe catalog has two in-stock, new monitors:\n- **MN-27**: 27-inch 4K, $329 each\n- **MN-32**: 32-inch 5K, $529 each\n\nI found no purchase history or other record that identifies the design team's standard, so I didn't want to guess.\n\nThe docks are settled: DK-200 is in stock and new, so I'd order 3 \u00d7 DK-200 at $189 each ($567). I would not use the refurbished DK-200-R, and DK-210 is only needed if DK-200 becomes unavailable.\n\nTotals for the full order (3 docks plus 3 monitors) would be:\n- With MN-27: $1,554\n- With MN-32: $2,154\n\nBoth are under the $2,500 threshold, so manager approval isn't required.\n\nOnce you confirm the monitor model, I'll place a single order for 3 \u00d7 DK-200 and 3 \u00d7 that monitor, shipped to HQ. Note that I don't have the HQ address on file, so please also confirm the exact ship-to details.", "type": "text"}]}]}